          },
          "description": "This soothing, mindful bedtime story gently explores the feeling of anger. Young Lotus has a big, fiery moment. Then, in a discussion with Parent Lotus, Young Lotus learns that taking time to pause, breathe and to understand, they discover bees aren’t bad at all. A mindful journey perfect for little listeners and grown-ups who tuck them in.\nThe artwork for the cover was made by my granddaughter Sonali when she was six years old. Her drawing was my inspiration to write this story and more!",
